# The glossy Cornell Box material library.
# Part of the Cornell Box set from Williams College (see copyright.txt).
# Note that the real box is not a perfect cube, so
# the faces are imperfect in this data set.
#
# Source: http://graphics.cs.williams.edu/data
# License: CC BY 3.0 (see LICENSE-CC-BY-3.0.txt)
# Original Cornell Box data: http://www.graphics.cornell.edu/online/box/data.html
# Exported from 3ds Max with Wavefront OBJ Exporter v0.97b
# (c) 2007 guruware, 2012-12-05.
# Modified for this project: added the `light` material below. The
# shipped .mtl omits it even though CornellBox-Glossy.obj uses
# `usemtl light`, which left the scene without an emitter.
# Dataset attribution: Guedis Cardenas and Morgan McGuire, Williams College
#
# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-3.0

newmtl sphere
	Ns 40.0000
	Ni 1.5000
	d 1.0000
	Tr 0.0000
	Tf 1.0000 1.0000 1.0000 
	illum 2
	Ka 0.4860 0.6310 0.6630
	Kd 0.4860 0.6310 0.6630
	Ks 0.9000 0.9000 0.9000
	Ke 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000

